  "Overall strength of the neural pass. At 0 this is a plain DLAA resolve. The add-on's own range is 0..2; it stops changing above 2.": "神经渲染整体强度。设为 0 时仅进行普通 DLAA 处理。插件范围为 0..2，超过 2 后不再变化。",
  "Subsurface scattering and pore detail on faces. Lower this first if results look waxy.": "控制人脸的次表面散射与毛孔细节。如果结果显得蜡感或塑料感，优先降低此项。",
  "How much the model may relight the scene.": "控制模型重新调整场景光照的程度。",
  "Micro-contrast in fabric, hair, and surface material.": "控制织物、头发与材质表面的微对比和细节。",
  "Re-run DLSS automatically when a slider changes. The add-on reads its settings only when the harness starts, so each change costs a restart — about four seconds, most of it NGX and add-on initialisation.": "滑块变化后自动重新运行 DLSS。插件只在运行环境启动时读取设置，因此每次修改都需要重启一次处理进程，通常约 4 秒，其中大部分时间用于 NGX 与插件初始化。",
  "DLSS is temporal. One pass leaves its accumulator empty; the result firms up over the first few and stops changing by about eight.": "DLSS 使用时序累积。只运行一次时累积器几乎为空；前几次迭代会逐渐稳定，通常到约 8 次后变化很小。",
  "Run a whole folder with the current single-image settings.": "使用当前单张图片设置处理整个文件夹。",
  "Asks for an export size first. Defaults to native.": "保存前会先询问导出尺寸，默认使用原始尺寸。",
  "The add-on's overall look.\n\nDefault — the look DLSS 5 starts with.\nNatural — subtle grade, closer to the source.\nCinematic — stronger grade, moves furthest from the source.": "插件的整体视觉风格。\n\n默认 — DLSS 5 启动后的基础效果。\n自然 — 调整较轻，更接近原图。\n电影感 — 调整更强，与原图差异最大。",
  "Which Depth Anything V2 model estimates depth. Small ships with the app; Base and Large are more detailed and download once when chosen.": "选择用于估算深度的 Depth Anything V2 模型。Small 随应用提供；Base 和 Large 细节更丰富，首次选择时会下载一次。",
  "Compact — parameters become a row of chips over one slider, so a group of four sliders takes one slider's height.\n\nFull — every slider is shown at once, the classic stacked layout.": "紧凑 — 多个参数显示为一排切换按钮，共用一个滑块，节省侧栏空间。\n\n完整 — 同时显示所有滑块，采用传统纵向堆叠布局。"
